"intro": "Mr Grant was knocked over by a van while crossing the road, and he's suing the van driver. Ann, a bystander, saw it all but has since emigrated. Her friend Ben, the expert Dr Shah and Mr Grant's grown-up daughter Lucy all have a part. Let's see what evidence makes it through the hall of mirrors...",
